  "faqStudentQ1": "How to find a tutor?",
  "faqStudentA1": "Use the search bar to find available tutors based on the subject or topic you need.",
  "faqStudentQ2": "How do I book a session?",
  "faqStudentA2": "Once you find a tutor, check their profile and select an available time slot that suits you. Click \"Book\" and follow the instructions to confirm your session.",
  "faqStudentQ3": "What if I need to cancel or reschedule?",
  "faqStudentA3": "Tutoring sessions cannot be canceled once booked. If any inconvenience occurred, contact us and we will gladly help you.",
  "faqStudentQ4": "How do I pay for sessions?",
  "faqStudentA4": "Payments are made through the QR provided in your reservation or by bank transfer with the data shown on the screen.",
  "faqStudentQ5": "What should I do if my tutor doesn't show up?",
  "faqStudentA5": "If your tutor does not show up for a scheduled session, contact support immediately for assistance and to schedule a reschedule or refund.",
  "faqStudentQ6": "How can I leave feedback?",
  "faqStudentA6": "Go to the tutor's profile, scroll down to the reviews section, where you can see student ratings and comments.",
  "faqTutorQ1": "How can I become a tutor?",
  "faqTutorA1": "Create an account, fill out the form, and at the end select \"Tutor\". Create your profile and send the necessary documentation for approval.",
  "faqTutorQ2": "What qualifications do I need to be a tutor?",
  "faqTutorA2": "Academic qualification is not a requirement. If you want to teach \"something\" you can do it.",
  "faqTutorQ3": "How do I set my availability?",
  "faqTutorA3": "Log in to your account, go to the “Manage available time” section, and update your calendar with your available time slots.",
  "faqTutorQ4": "What should I do if a student cancels?",
  "faqTutorA4": "Students do not have the option to cancel a session after booking. If the student informs you of a problem, recommend them to write to our contact for help.",
